I now get:

Item          Cancel       Shopkeeper
Descr:        Location:    Angry?
Blessed Oil   S4           No (no bug)
Blessed Oil   S3           No (no bug)
Blessed Oil   S2           No (no bug)
Blessed Oil   S1           No (no bug)
Blessed R.A.  S4           No (no bug)
Blessed R.A.  S3           No (no bug)
Blessed R.A.  S2           No (no bug)
Blessed R.A.  S1           No (no bug)

So it does seem to fix the bug.

As for there now being only three zones, no.  Shops still
have inside, free-zone, warn-zone, and outside, and they
still all have different attributes.  I think the only
thing that's quirky and counter-intuitive is is the "free"
square immediately inside the door.  I think it would make
more sense to make that square part of the shop.  It would
make the game more challenging in the sense that shoplifting
by pet would be slightly more difficult.  And it would be
more in line with what new users would expect.

